  "name": "qwen3-vl-plus",
  "displayName": "Qwen3-VL-Plus",
  "provider": "Qwen",
  "description": "Alibaba's advanced vision-language model with superior visual understanding capabilities. It demonstrates strong performance on multimodal benchmarks requiring fine-grained visual recognition, spatial reasoning, and cross-modal alignment. The model can interpret complex images, charts, diagrams, and documents while maintaining coherent text generation. Suitable for applications demanding high accuracy in visual comprehension such as medical imaging analysis, architectural design review, and educational content creation.",
  "zhDescription": "阿里巴巴高级视觉语言模型，具有卓越的视觉理解能力。在需要细粒度视觉识别、空间推理和跨模态对齐的多模态基准测试中表现出色。该模型可以解释复杂的图像、图表、示意图和文档，同时保持连贯的文本生成。适用于对视觉理解准确性要求高的应用，如医学影像分析、建筑设计审查和教育内容创作。",
  "longDescription": "Alibaba's advanced vision-language model with superior visual understanding capabilities. It demonstrates strong performance on multimodal benchmarks requiring fine-grained visual recognition, spatial reasoning, and cross-modal alignment. The model can interpret complex images, charts, diagrams, and documents while maintaining coherent text generation. Suitable for applications demanding high accuracy in visual comprehension such as medical imaging analysis, architectural design review, and educational content creation.",
  "zhLongDescription": "阿里巴巴高级视觉语言模型，具有卓越的视觉理解能力。在需要细粒度视觉识别、空间推理和跨模态对齐的多模态基准测试中表现出色。该模型可以解释复杂的图像、图表、示意图和文档，同时保持连贯的文本生成。适用于对视觉理解准确性要求高的应用，如医学影像分析、建筑设计审查和教育内容创作。",
